{"1024120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Túatha Echoes: The Village", "steam_appid": 1024120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2369770, 1025470, 2369774, 2369771], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immerse yourself in a psychological horror story set in the rich and mysterious fantasy worlds of Túatha.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Túatha Echoes: The Village</strong> is the first story in the <i>Echoes</i> series, introducing the unique setting of Túatha inspired by pre-Celtic mythology and lore. This short visual novel invites you to uncover the grim fate of a small forest village, where something dark has taken root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first <i>Echo</i> in a series of stories, <strong>The Village</strong> sets the stage for a magical world steeped in ancient lore. With beautifully illustrated scenes and a dark chilling narrative, this visual novel offers a glimpse into the legends and characters that will shape the future of the Túatha universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark depths of a world filled with magic and mystery and join us as we forge a new fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tuatha Echoes: The Village </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Linear Story</strong>: Enjoy a simple linear narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Worldbuilding</strong>: Delve into the lore of Túatha, uncovering dark secrets that hint at deeper mysteries yet to be explored. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Experience the slow descent into madness through atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"